<h1>A script past its deadline reports the deadline</h1>
<p>With {{ release.tag }}, a script that outlives its timer fails with the deadline error and its timeout in milliseconds. A stopped turn still fails as cancelled, so the error tells a slow script from a stopped one.</p>
