<h2>A rollback is a binary swap</h2>
<p>No configuration, credential file or stored format changed, so swapping both daemons back is the whole rollback. Upgrade and roll back <code>dekopon-gatewayd</code> and <code>dekopon-brokerd</code> together.</p>
</section>

